1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,238
接下来是我比较熟悉的部分
Next is an area I know well:

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:03,140
国际物流
international logistics.

3
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:06,258
假设这位卖家从海外工厂采购商品
Assume the seller sources goods overseas

4
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:07,520
运到美国销售
to sell in the United States.

5
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:10,760
商品生产完成以后需要安排运输
Once production ends, shipping begins.

6
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:12,198
如果走海运
If the goods travel by sea

7
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:16,460
货物要经过国内运输出口港口海上运输
the journey includes trucking, an export port and ocean freight

8
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:17,960
再到美国港口
before reaching a US port.

9
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:21,320
到港以后还要产生清关进口关税
Arrival also involves customs clearance and import duties

10
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:22,638
码头费用
terminal charges

11
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:25,820
以及送货到亚马逊仓库的运输费用
and transport to an Amazon warehouse.

12
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:28,520
这些钱都要算进商品的成本
These costs belong in the cost calculation.

13
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:32,120
我们假设这部分费用合计一万两千美元
Assume this stage totals $12,000.

14
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:34,458
刚才剩下八万五千美元
We had $85,000 remaining.

15
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:36,378
再减去一万两千美元
Subtract another $12,000.

16
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,540
现在还剩七万三千美元
Now the balance is $73,000.
